# ::gentoo masks dev-lang/python[jit] in profiles/base (2024-06-29: the
# upstream JIT is experimental). bentoo's dev-lang/python mirror makes the
# flag buildable with LLVM 21, 22 and 23, so it is offered here, but only as
# an opt-in: IUSE keeps it off by default and this line enables nothing on
# its own (a global USE=jit in make.conf does reach it, by design).
#
# The atom is qualified ::bentoo on purpose. A bare atom is NOT confined to
# this repository here: it unmasked ::gentoo's python too (measured
# 2026-11-07), whose LLVM_COMPAT=( 21 ) then fails REQUIRED_USE for anyone
# with a global USE=jit and LLVM_SLOT != 21.
# Remove together with the dev-lang/python mirror.
dev-lang/python:3.15::bentoo -jit
